00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.040
and asked it to do the same thing, it was really bad at that.

214
00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:23.040
It seemed to not be able to look at docs and find edge cases

215
00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:27.480
in the way that I can, so that was kind of interesting.

216
00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:33.120
But so but sometimes if you asked it,

217
00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:36.320
if I mean, sometimes I found edge cases through test coverage issues

